# Claude Context (forced)

Semantic code search: embeddings (Ollama `nomic-embed-text`) + Milvus (`127.0.0.1:19530`). Fully local.

- Conceptual or codebase-wide questions: `search_code` via `mcptoon_call claude-context search_code`.
- Exact symbols: prefer jCodeMunch. Semantic engines find concepts; jCodeMunch returns source.
- Index first: `index_codebase`, confirm with `get_indexing_status`.
- Dense-only (`HYBRID_MODE=false`); hybrid fails on this Milvus build. Backend must be up (colima/Docker + Ollama + Milvus).
